{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_6","type":"agent_message","text":"\n```powershell\n$ErrorActionPreference = \"Stop\"\n$ProgressPreference = \"SilentlyContinue\"\n\n# Create docs directory\n$docsDir = \"C:\\Users\\hzq00\\codex-with-chatgpt\\docs\\windows-onboarding\"\nNew-Item -Path $docsDir -ItemType Directory -Force | Out-Null\n\n$mdPath = Join-Path $docsDir \"cloudflared.md\"\n\n@'\n# Windows cloudflared 安装文档\n\n## 1. 快速安装（推荐 - 非交互模式）\n\n```powershell\nwinget install --id Cloudflare.cloudflared --disable-interactivity --accept-package-agreements --accept-source-agreements\n```\n\n## 2. 用户级无管理员权限回退安装\n\n```powershell\n# 1. 注册 winget 源（如果未注册）\nwinget source add -n winget-microsoft -r https://cdn.winget.microsoft.com/cache\n\n# 2. 安装到用户目录（不要求管理员权限）\nwinget install --id Cloudflare.cloudflared --location \"C:\\Users\\hzq00\\AppData\\Local\\cloudflared\" --disable-interactivity --accept-package-agreements --accept-source-agreements\n\n# 3. 添加到 PATH（仅当前用户）\n$env:Path += \";$env:USERPROFILE\\AppData\\Local\\cloudflared\"\n[Environment]::SetEnvironmentVariable(\"Path\", $env:Path, \"User\")\n```\n\n## 3. 手动安装（无 winget）\n\n```powershell\n# 下载最新 Windows amd64 版本\n$latest = Invoke-WebRequest -Uri \"https://github.com/cloudflare/cloudflared/releases/latest\" -UseBasicParsing\n$version = $latest.Links | Where-Object {$_.href -match \"cloudflared-windows-amd64.exe\"} | Select-Object -ExpandProperty href -First 1\n$downloadUrl = \"https://github.com\" + $version\n\n$downloadPath = \"C:\\Users\\hzq00\\Downloads\\cloudflared.exe\"\nInvoke-WebRequest -Uri $downloadUrl -OutFile $downloadPath\n\n# 移动到系统 PATH（用户级）\n$targetDir = \"C:\\Users\\hzq00\\AppData\\Local\\cloudflared\"\nNew-Item -Path $targetDir -ItemType Directory -Force | Out-Null\nCopy-Item $downloadPath $targetDir -Force\n$env:Path += \";$targetDir\"\n[Environment]::SetEnvironmentVariable(\"Path\", $env:Path, \"User\")\n```\n\n## 4. 版本验证\n\n```powershell\ncloudflared --version\n```\n\n## 5. 常见问题\n\n- **安装失败（权限错误